n uses Galois/Counter Mode (GCM) with an authentication tag for integrity checking. Added Central State ( src/modules/state.js ) Introduced a persistent state object capturing the current tier , accumulated xp , current role , computed rank and selected theme . State changes automatically update listeners and persist to settings.json in the user data directory via IPC. Added helper functions to load and save settings, mutate tier, XP, role and theme, and to register change listeners. • • • • • • 1 <PARSED TEXT FOR PAGE: 2 / 6> Tier Engine ( src/modules/tierEngine.js ) Added click handlers to the tier badges in the header. Selecting a numbered tier updates state.tier . Selecting the Founder or Sentinel badges promotes the user to that role and maxes the tier. Elements tagged with data-tier-req are automatically disabled until the required tier is reached. XP System ( src/modules/xpSystem.js ) Added a compact progress bar and rank indicator to the header. The bar fills as the user progresses from Novice (0–9 XP) to Operative (10–49 XP) and Architect (50+ XP). Added gainXP() helper to award XP from other modules. A single message send increments XP by 1 and logs to the timeline, while vault operations award 5 XP. Memory Timeline ( src/modules/memoryTimeline.js ) Implemented a simple logging utility that appends timestamped lines to the timeline panel whenever significant events occur (e.g. send, vault save/load, unlock). Uses dayjs if present and falls back to the browser’s locale formatting. Vault Encryption ( src/modules/vaultEncryption.js ) Added encrypted vault save and load functionality using the Web Crypto API (AES‑256‑GCM with a PBKDF2‑derived key). Users are prompted for a passphrase when saving or loading. Encrypted data is stored to a .vault file via the preload API. Loading merges persisted tier , xp , role and theme back into the running state and restores the console log. QR/Passphrase Unlock ( src/modules/qrUnlock.js ) Added a hidden founder unlock panel