</span> <span id="xpSpan"></span> </div> <div id="neuroDrop"> <span id="qrContainer"></span> </div> </div> </main> <!-- Optional QR library --> <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/qrcode@1.5.1/build/qrcode.min.js"></script> <script> (function() { // Session state const startTime = Date.now(); let tasks = []; let logs = []; let memory = []; let vaultLocal = []; let vaultRemote = []; let llmConnected = false; let lastActionTime = Date.now(); let autopilotActive = false; // Active persona (default/founder/override/god) let persona = 'default'; // Phase 341–360 state // Currently selected core/OS mode let currentCore = 'default'; // Remote key for vault linking let remoteKey = ''; // XP tracking let xpPoints = 0; // Phase to feature mapping const phaseCache = { '316-325': ['Persona router', 'Terminal parser', 'Persistent settings'], '326-340': ['QR ritual scan', 'Enhanced .tear import', 'Chat memory vault timeline loader', 'Local LLM toggle', 'VaultHook Sync'], '341-360': ['Core Switcher', 'Remote VaultLinking', 'Phase Map', 'Trigger Injection', 'NeuroXP'] , '361-380': ['NeuralCortex memory routing', 'AutoPersona cycling', 'Quantum Simulation', 'VaultRecall overlay', 'RitualSync scripts', 'Companion panel', 'Command Scheduler', 'Clipboard AI', 'NeuralMind overlay', 'Memory Fusion', 'GuardianLoop safety', 'Direct LLM Terminal input', 'VaultFX animations'], '381-400': ['CrossReality Bridge', 'Persona Merge', 'Neural Context Vault', 'Terminal AI enhancements', 'Tier Unlocker multi triggers', 'Chat Fusion', 'DevTimeTracker v2', 'DeepVault Recall', 'VaultComm bridge', 'Node Echo', 'CodeSoulSync'] , '401-450': ['DOM Ritual Sync', 'SmartLaunch ritual', 'PhaseLocked ritual', 'TerminalVerse ritual', 'LLM bridge dynamic switching', 'Vault lock & QR triggers', '.tear export finaliser', 'Terminal DOM injection', 'DevAgent parallel sync'] , '451-500': ['Vault Memory Compactor','AutoTrigger rituals','Chat History Loader','PhaseLock Engine','Tier Finalizer','Feedback Loop','NeuralDrive Link','Token Authenticator','Self Verification','Auto‑Cloak','Archive Cleaner','Phoenix Mode'] , // Phase 601–700: Execution Fusion upgrades '601-700': ['LLM Router','Command Console','Vault Navigator v2','Execution Timeline','Runtime Editor','Memory Tracker','Phase Map View','Error Catcher','CoreBridge Sync','Execution Flame FX','TierUnlock v2','NeuralPersona Loader','Override Trigger','Full Dev Mode'] }; // Phase 361–400 state // Memory routing pools let memoryShort = []; let memoryLong = []; // Chat sessions for ChatFusion let chatSessions = []; let currentThreadIndex = -1; // Persona cycle interval id let personaCycleInterval = null; // Guardian loop last prompt let lastPrompt = ''; // VaultFX animations for visual feedback function vaultFX(type) { let color; if (type === 'error') color = '#ff5555'; else if (type === 'success') color = '#55ff55'; else if (type === 'fail') color = '#ffaa00'; else color = 'var(--highlight)'; document.body.style.boxShadow = `0 0 20px ${color} inset`; setTimeout(() => { document.body.style.boxShadow = ''; }, 300); } // DOM refs const tierEls = document.querySelectorAll('.tier'); const llmSelect = document.getElementById('llmSelect'); const connectBtn = document.getElementById('connectBtn'); const llmStatus = document.getElementById('llmStatus'); const tokenCount = document.getElementById('tokenCount'); const llmInput = document.getElementById('llmInput'); const sendBtn = document.getElementById('sendBtn'); const llmOutput = document.getElementById('llmOutput'); const ritualSelect = document.getElementById('ritualSelect'); const ritualTrigger = document.getElementById('ritualTrigger'); const audioToggle = document.getElementById('audioToggle'); const glowToggle = document.getElementById('glowToggle'); const nightToggle = document.getElementById('nightToggle'); const typewriterToggle = document.getElementById('typewriterToggle'); const autopilotToggle = document.getElementById('autopilotToggle'); const taskList = document.getE